<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-022" chapter-id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi" source-id="s-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi-ws1477957">
  <p id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABA">承</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABA">安期</persName>，初為秘書郎，累遷中書黃門侍郎，兼國子博士。時<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001:u0027" type="unresolved">膏腴貴遊</rs>，咸以文學相尚，罕以經術為業；唯<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001:m0047" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABA">承</persName>獨好儒業。遷長兼侍中，俄轉國子祭酒。<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001:m0066" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABA">承</persName>祖<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001:m0068" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA">儉</persName>父<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001:m0070" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAAB">暕</persName>皆為此職，三世為國師，前代未之有。久之，出為東陽太守。政存寬惠，<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p001:u0103" type="unresolved">吏人</rs>悅之。卒郡，諡曰章。</p>
  <p id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABA">承</persName>性簡貴，有風格。右衛<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0011" ref="4nv_kdx_8z9">朱異</persName>當朝用事，每休下，車馬填門。有魏郡<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0030" ref="pbw_yt5_4sx">申英</persName>者，門寒才俊，好危言高論以忤<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:u0046" type="unresolved">權右</rs>。嘗指<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0051" ref="4nv_kdx_8z9">異</persName>門曰：「此中輻湊，皆為利往，能不至者，唯<rs id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:u0072" type="unresolved">大小王東陽</rs>耳。」小東陽即<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0084" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABA">承</persName>弟<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0086" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABB">幼</persName>也。時唯<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0091" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAABA">承</persName>兄弟及<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0095" ref="jyx_72x_8t2_AAA">褚翔</persName>不至<persName id="c-nanshi-022-wangcheng-anqi:p002:m0099" ref="4nv_kdx_8z9">異</persName>門，世並稱之。</p>
</text>
